@startuml BlackoutRadar_SystemContext

title BlackoutRadar — System Context

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor User
actor Administrator

rectangle "BlackoutRadar" as System

cloud "Energy Company\nWebsites" as Websites
cloud "Open Source\nParser" as Parser
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
collections "Object Storage\n(MinIO)" as MinIO
queue "SMTP Server" as SMTP
queue "Telegram API" as Telegram

User --> System : Manage subscriptions\nReceive notifications

Administrator --> System : Manage sources\nManage users

Websites --> Parser : HTML / PDF / DOC / RTF
Parser --> System : Parsed outages

System --> DB : Store domain data
System --> MinIO : Store avatars
System --> SMTP : Email notifications
System --> Telegram : Telegram notifications

@enduml